### Registrar usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Diana Rodriguez",
    "email": "diana@test.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "diana@test.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###

### Crear objeto (requiere estar logueada)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/objetos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "titulo": "Taladro inalámbrico",
    "descripcion": "Bosch 18V con baterías",
    "categoria": "herramientas"
}

### Editar objeto - caso feliz
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/objetos/6a2d92677f05f3782a0d4a47
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "titulo": "Taladro Bosch actualizado",
    "descripcion": "Con maletín y mechas",
    "categoria": "herramientas"
}

###

### Editar objeto - caso fallo (id inexistente)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/objetos/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "titulo": "Esto no existe",
    "descripcion": "Id inválido",
    "categoria": "herramientas"
}

### Eliminar objeto - caso feliz
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/objetos/6a2d94ac57c0a260df400cdf
### Eliminar objeto - caso fallo (id inexistente)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/objetos/000000000000000000000000


GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/perfil 
Content-Type: application/json

### PROBAMOS REGISTER
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/register 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Bohemian Rhapsody",
    "email": "peron123@gmail.com",
    "password": "floresmarillas123"
}

### PROBAMOS LOGIN
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/login 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "peron123@gmail.com",
    "password": "floresmarillas123"
}

### PROBAMOS LA SESSION Y LOS PERMISOS.

GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/perfil

### PROBAMOS LOGOUT

POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/logout
